Hi,

I have made some updates to twclock. It displays local time, GMT,
and the current time at hundreds of locations around the world.

It also has an ID timer that flashes and/or blinks when it is time
to ID.  The delay time can be set at runtime for 0 seconds (?) to 
about one week.

Source code and statically linked binary versions are available.  
The static version just needs to be untar'd and installed - no compile
needed.

Find them at http://wa0eir.ham.org

Enjoy!

